# What the app needs, as floors. **Edit this file, then run `make lock`** --
# requirements.txt is generated from it by `uv pip compile --universal
# --generate-hashes`, with every package, transitive ones included, pinned
# exactly and hashed, and that generated file is what every install reads
# (#46). CI re-runs the compile and fails a pull request whose lock does not
# match this file.

